OL,3,GNEWSAFlooding causes disruption to road
OL,4,Aand rail travel
OL,5,
OL,6,FStorms across the West Midlands have
OL,7,Fled to more travel disruption.
OL,9,FHeavy rain flooded Hall Green station,
OL,10,Fcausing disruption on the line between
OL,11,FKidderminster/Birmingham Moor Street
OL,12,Fand Whitlocks End/Stratford-upon-Avon.
OL,13,FPassengers were able to use their
OL,14,Ftickets on bus services, West Midlands
OL,15,FRailway said.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
