OL,3,GNEWSAFlooding causes disruption to road
OL,4,Aand rail travel
OL,5,
OL,6,FA flood warning for the Spadesbourne
OL,7,FBrook in Bromsgrove was issued and the
OL,8,FMet Office said a yellow warning for
OL,9,Fheavy rain and thunderstorms was in
OL,10,Fplace. Police issued notices for
OL,11,Fdrivers to be careful if out in the
OL,12,Frain saying there was a lot of surface
OL,13,Fwater.
OL,15,FThe disruption follows a few days of
OL,16,Fheavy rain in the region.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
